mission "Talk at the Quay"
    category "ambient"
    ambient true
    offer_at "port"
    repeatable true
    cooldown 300
    max_triggers 1
    priority 1
    offer_expression "docked and flag('quay_talk_heard') == false"
    speaker offer "Two sailors at the quay"
    on offer
        conversation
            `As you cross the quay, two sailors fall quiet beside a stack of water casks. One waits until you have passed, then mutters, "That one has the look of a captain who might listen."`
            `"I heard the governor's customs men have been searching every vessel from the western passage," says the other. "Not for contraband, neither. They're looking for a passenger who isn't supposed to exist."`
            choice
                `"Do you know who they're looking for?"`
                `"Best not to get mixed up in another man's business."`
                    set_flag "quay_talk_heard" true
                    close
            `The first sailor shakes his head. "Only that the order came from the governor's own office. That's enough for me to keep my head down."`
            set_flag "quay_talk_heard" true
